cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  PhenoRewire has not yet been formally published.
  If you use this software in a manuscript, please cite the repository
  directly until a formal citation (DOI, paper) is available.
title: "PhenoRewire: phenotype-aware metabolomics network rewiring"
abstract: >-
  PhenoRewire is a Python command-line tool for detecting network rewiring
  in metabolomics data. It identifies metabolite features whose correlation
  neighbourhood reorganised between two biological states — a complementary
  signal to differential abundance analysis.
authors:
